I create decks from the open documentations or free papers I found here or there. The decks are built with a custom made pipeline of skills to extract the data, select questions, creating distractors and verification. I'm curating the entire process.&lt;p&gt;To keep cards up-to-date I have a weekly automated routine to check release notes of selected topics and curating new cards.&lt;p&gt;From the beginning I also realized just the random algorithm to show cards is not very efficient, so I implemented two spaced-repetition algorithms SM-2 and FSRS.&lt;p&gt;Would you like to check it and give me some feedback? It's free, no sign-up needed&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
