- Events are natural language, with fuzzy dates
- Simple Apple Health insight extraction
- Export as prompt
- Local first, no account required&lt;p&gt;The thinking is that, for most health queries to AI I want my personal health context to be part of the input. And don't want to rewrite every time.&lt;p&gt;Curious whether this approach makes sense to other people.
Try the app and share your thoughts!&lt;/p&gt;
